./docs/dpdk-dataplane.md:60:Add a DPDK-based dataplane as an alternative to the current XDP/TC eBPF pipeline. The existing `pkg/dataplane.Manager` API is already well-abstracted — the daemon, CLI, gRPC, config system, and all subsystems interact through this interface, not through BPF-specific code. A DPDK implementation would swap the packet processing engine while keeping everything else unchanged.
