./docs/dpdk-dataplane.md:64:| | XDP/TC (current) | DPDK (proposed) |
./docs/dpdk-dataplane.md:66:| **Throughput** | 25+ Gbps native XDP | 40-100+ Gbps with DPDK PMDs |
./docs/dpdk-dataplane.md:69:| **NIC support** | Any NIC with XDP driver | NICs with DPDK PMD (Intel, Mellanox, etc.) |
./docs/dpdk-dataplane.md:73:| **Deployment** | Zero-dependency (kernel built-in) | Requires hugepages, DPDK libs, dedicated cores |
